        "id": "executive_form_a",
        "title": "PA inbox check",
        "brief": "Ten emails and voicemails from the inbox of a PA at Merrin & Sallow Architects. For each one, choose Trust, Report, Delete or Verify (ring someone on a number you already hold), then tick what you noticed. You'll see how you did at the end. Checking or reporting something real never costs you anything.",
